The Far Realms is a [[Phenomena/Joker World|Joker World]] on the [[Geography/Færrin/Infinite Horizon/index|Infinite Horizon]], the one the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence/index|Providence]] stands on.

[[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]], a company from beyond the [[Phenomena/Firmament|firmament]] whose mark is a triangle of sixteen dots, was shipwrecked here. It began in a different Far Realms, the one on [[Geography/Ushas/index|Ushas]], where its founders found a wrecked [[Org/The Fifth Prosperous Empire of the Sundom|Sundom]] starship. Here its people raised [[Geography/Færrin/Infinite Horizon/Far Realms/Hesperid 3|Hesperid 3]], a refining works a hundred miles east of the misted crater, and ran a rail north from it to their ship, the [[Geography/Færrin/Infinite Horizon/Far Realms/Hesperid|Hesperid]], which lies on its side on a gray waste.
